[Brennan: adapted to 5.10, which predates the cifs multichannel state
 machine: ses->ses_lock/ses_status/SES_EXITING become
 GlobalMid_Lock/ses->status/CifsExiting, and ses->need_reconnect stands
 in for the chans_need_reconnect bitmap. Also folds in upstream
 f3191fc8004d ("cifs: do not send tree disconnect to ipc shares"),
 never backported to linux-5.10.y: it only simplified cifs_free_ipc()
 ahead of this fix deleting that function outright, so nothing survives
 to backport as a separate patch.]
